{"availability":"available","full":"prantikmedhi/spotibadge","name":"spotibadge","description":"Dynamic Spotify README badges for GitHub profiles: now playing, recently played, top tracks, and top artists as customizable SVG widgets.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":6,"forks":1,"created":"2026-05-28T21:47:18Z","updated":"2026-05-29T06:51:46Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://spotibadge.vercel.app","topics":["dynamic-svg","flask","github-profile","music-widget","now-playing","python","readme-badge","spotify","spotify-api","vercel"],"demo":"https://spotibadge.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:16.150Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:16.150Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:16.150Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T21:27:16.150Z","stars":6,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["SpotiBadge generates dynamic Spotify README badges for GitHub profiles, portfolios, and project pages. Show your real-time now playing track, recently played songs, top tracks, or top artists as a customizable SVG widget. No database, no trackers, just your music.","Use the hosted app at spotibadge.vercel.app to generate your badge without writing a single line of code.","SpotiBadge is a no-code Spotify now playing badge generator for GitHub README profiles. It uses Spotify OAuth, Flask, Jinja2 SVG templates, and Vercel-friendly stateless URLs to render live music widgets without storing user data."],"features":["Real-Time Now Playing: Instantly displays the song you are currently vibing to on Spotify.","Recently Played Fallback: If you pause your music, the widget automatically falls back to showing your most recently played track.","BPM-Synced Equalizer: The animated EQ bars pulse and change color based on the actual Tempo (BPM) and Energy of the track.","Dynamic Blur Themes: The widget extracts a color palette from the album art to generate a beautiful, dynamic blurred background.","Stateless & Secure: No database is required! Your Spotify credentials are encrypted and signed directly into the widget URL."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/prantikmedhi/spotibadge/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"4b6b34ac86954320d495301ec09692726b4a012fb481cd6df5847c64374c1707","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:16.286Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:16.286Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"SpotiBadge generates dynamic Spotify README badges for GitHub profiles, portfolios, and project pages. Show your real-time now playing track, recently played songs, top tracks, or top artists as a customizable SVG widget. No database, no trackers, just your music.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/prantikmedhi/spotibadge/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"optional","text":"👉 Read the Full Setup Guide (SETUP.md) if you want to self-host or use your own Spotify Developer credentials.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/prantikmedhi/spotibadge/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Once you generate your publicid via the login flow, you can interact with these core endpoints:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/prantikmedhi/spotibadge/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"4b6b34ac86954320d495301ec09692726b4a012fb481cd6df5847c64374c1707","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/prantikmedhi/spotibadge/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:16.287Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-05-29T06:51:46Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/prantikmedhi/spotibadge/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:16.288Z","hash":"4b6b34ac86954320d495301ec09692726b4a012fb481cd6df5847c64374c1707","originalBytes":5267,"storedBytes":5267,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["spotify","svg","color","badge","public","widget","get","top","spotibadge","term","api","now","played","playing","recently","range","redirect","short","